<h2>How often should I test cortisol?</h2>
<p>There is no universal consumer testing frequency. The schedule depends on why a clinician is testing and which method is used. Repeated tests without a defined question can be difficult to interpret. Persistent or concerning symptoms deserve clinical assessment rather than repeated app checks.</p>
<h2>What if my goal is to lower cortisol?</h2>
<p>First distinguish everyday stress management from treating a diagnosed hormone disorder. Our <a href="/cortisol/lower/">guide to lowering cortisol levels and managing stress naturally</a> explains practical habits, evidence limits and when medical care matters.</p>
